OFFER CONFORMANCE EVALUATION
In addition to the elements described above, SDG&E may also reject an offer if:
1. SDG&E  uncovers  evidence  of  market  manipulation  or  unlawful  collusion  in  the  offer preparation and offer process;
2. the  Respondent  does  not  provide  adequate  evidence  that  it  meets  minimum  participation criteria;
3. the Respondent is unable to comply with RFO timing and other solicitation requirements.

